sentences.text:
4. Hence, the following:
ORDER (i) The impugned general award dated 10.04.2023 at Annexure-A to the writ petition insofar as the land of the petitioners, which is the subject matter of the instant writ petition, is set aside;
(ii) The respondent/Special Land Acquisition Officer of the KIADB is directed to consider the request of the petitioners for award of compensation by way of an agreement under Section 29(2) of the Karnataka Industrial Areas Development Act and pass necessary orders within a period of three months from the date of receipt of a copy of this order;
(iii) If the policy of the Government/KIADB permits grant of developed land in lieu of monetary NC: 2024:KHC:31673 compensation to the petitioners, the same shall be considered and granted by the respondents in accordance with law;
(iv) The respondent/Special Land Acquisition Officer, KIADB, is at liberty to withdraw the amount that has been deposited by it pursuant to the general award before the jurisdictional Court;
(v) It is needless to state that, in the event the petitioners failing to provide necessary documents to establish their ownership over the land concerned, or if there is a dispute as to ownership, the general award would stand restored;

